Package: HaploTraitR
Type: Package
Title: Haplotype-Based Trait Analysis for Plant Breeding
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alsamman", "Alsamman", , "aalsamman100@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tamara", "Ortiz", , "tamara.ortizru@gmail.com", role = "ctb"),
    person("Khaled", "Helmy", , "khaledhelmy444@gmail.com", role = "ctb"),
    person("Zakaria", "Kehel", , "z.kehel@cgiar.org", role = "ctb"),
    person("ICARDA", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Builds haplotype blocks (SNPs in linkage disequilibrium) around
    significant GWAS SNPs, tests the effect of each haplotype on a trait and
    reports superior haplotypes, diagnostic markers and candidate parents for
    breeders as publication-ready plots and a formatted Excel workbook.
